<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Owner Check | Arrington Consultancy</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A small, growing library of short self-assessment checks for owners of established, owner run businesses. No jargon, no generic advice - just practical insight in a few minutes.">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/owner-check">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Owner Check | Arrington Consultancy">
    <meta property="og:description" content="A small, growing library of short self-assessment checks for owners of established, owner run businesses.">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/owner-check">
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icons/icon-32.png" type="image/png" sizes="32x32">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icons/icon-16.png" type="image/png" sizes="16x16">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700;1,400&family=DM+Serif+Display&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=AW-18129914078"></script>
    <script nonce="<%= nonce %>">
        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
        function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
        gtag('js', new Date());
        gtag('config', 'AW-18129914078');
        <% if (ga4Id) { %>
        gtag('config', '<%= ga4Id %>');
        <% } %>
    </script>
    <style nonce="<%= nonce %>">
        :root {
            <% for (const [prop, val] of Object.entries(theme.vars)) { %>
            <%= prop %>: <%= val %>;
            <% } %>
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            background: var(--black);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        header {
            padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        header a.oc-logo-link { display: inline-flex; }
        header img { height: 32px; width: auto; }
        header .oc-back-link {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        header .oc-back-link:hover, header .oc-back-link:focus-visible { color: var(--accent); }

        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: var(--text-bright);
            line-height: 1.22;
            margin: 0 0 1rem;
        }
        p { color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 1.2rem; }

        .oc-label {
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: block;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.9rem;
            border-radius: 3px;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: var(--black); border-color: var(--accent); }
        .btn-primary:hover, .btn-primary:focus-visible { background: var(--accent-hover); border-color: var(--accent-hover); }
        .btn-outline { background: transparent; color: var(--text-bright); border-color: var(--border); }
        .btn-outline:hover, .btn-outline:focus-visible { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
        .btn-disabled {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border-color: var(--border);
            cursor: default;
        }

        /* Hero */
        .oc-hero {
            position: relative;
            min-height: 62vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-end;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .oc-hero-photo {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            object-position: center 40%;
        }
        .oc-hero-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55) 65%, var(--black) 100%);
        }
        .oc-hero-inner {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 720px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 4rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .oc-hero-inner h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.2rem);
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .oc-hero-inner p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.86);
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
        }

        main { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }

        /* Trust strip */
        .oc-trust {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 2.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            padding: 3rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
        }
        .oc-trust-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.65rem;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
        .oc-trust-item svg { flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--accent); }

        /* Checks */
        #checks { padding-bottom: 1rem; }
        .oc-checks-head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
        .oc-checks-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 4.5rem; }

        .check-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 2.25rem;
        }
        .check-card-head {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: baseline;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .check-card h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0; }
        .check-card-time {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .check-card-desc { font-size: 1.02rem; }
        .check-card-learn {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }
        .check-card ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
        }
        .check-card ul li {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 1.15rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text);
        }
        .check-card ul li::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 0.55em;
            width: 5px;
            height: 5px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent);
        }
        .check-card--soon { opacity: 0.72; }
        .check-card--soon .check-card-time { color: var(--accent); }

        /* Next section */
        .oc-next {
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 4rem 0 5rem;
        }
        .oc-next h2 { font-size: 1.9rem; }
        .oc-next p { max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <a href="/" class="oc-logo-link" aria-label="Arrington Consultancy home">
            <img src="/img/logo" alt="Arrington Business Consultancy">
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="oc-back-link">&larr; Back to site</a>
    </header>

    <section class="oc-hero">
        <img src="/img/owner-check/hero.jpg" alt="" class="oc-hero-photo">
        <div class="oc-hero-overlay"></div>
        <div class="oc-hero-inner">
            <h1>Owner Check</h1>
            <p>Sometimes it's difficult to see your own business clearly. These short checks help you step back, answer a few honest questions and understand where your biggest opportunities may be. No jargon. No generic advice. Just practical insight.</p>
            <a href="#checks" class="btn btn-primary">Start a Check</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <main>
        <div class="oc-trust">
            <div class="oc-trust-item">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3.5 2"/></svg>
                <span>Takes around 2-3 minutes</span>
            </div>
            <div class="oc-trust-item">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6z"/></svg>
                <span>Immediate results</span>
            </div>
            <div class="oc-trust-item">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="1.5"/><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4"/></svg>
                <span>Private and confidential</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="checks">
            <div class="oc-checks-head">
                <p class="oc-label">Choose a Check</p>
                <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem;">Two checks to start with</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="oc-checks-list">

                <!-- Check card template: duplicate this whole .check-card block for each future check -->
                <article class="check-card">
                    <div class="check-card-head">
                        <h2>Owner Dependency Quiz</h2>
                        <span class="check-card-time">About 2 minutes</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="check-card-desc">Discover how dependent your business is on you.</p>
                    <p class="check-card-learn">What you'll learn</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Where the business still relies too heavily on you day to day</li>
                        <li>Which pressure points and bottlenecks are building up</li>
                        <li>A dependency score you can act on immediately</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="/owner-dependency-quiz" class="btn btn-primary">Start Owner Dependency Quiz</a>
                </article>

                <article class="check-card">
                    <div class="check-card-head">
                        <h2>Market Ready Test</h2>
                        <span class="check-card-time">Around 5 minutes</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="check-card-desc">How ready is your business for a new owner?</p>
                    <p class="check-card-learn">What you'll learn</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>A New Owner Ready Score out of 100</li>
                        <li>What may make a buyer hesitate before making an offer</li>
                        <li>The priorities worth strengthening before you approach the market</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="/market-ready-test" class="btn btn-primary">Start Market Ready Test</a>
                </article>

            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="oc-next">
            <p class="oc-label" style="text-align:center;">What happens next?</p>
            <h2>Every check leaves you with something useful.</h2>
            <p>Some owners simply want clarity. Others decide they'd like another pair of experienced eyes. Either way, you'll leave knowing more than when you arrived.</p>
            <a href="/book-a-30-minute-conversation" class="btn btn-outline">Talk to Us</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
